{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40336","headline":"鹭鸶 · 刘象","name":"鹭鸶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洁白孤高生不同，顶丝清软冷摇风。\n窥鱼翘立荷香里，慕侣低翻柳影中。\n几日下巢辞紫阁，多时凝目向晴空。\n摩霄志在潜修羽，会接銮凰别苇丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}